include ../mixins/evidence.pug

h3(wiki="https://phasmophobia.fandom.com/wiki/Gallu") Gallu
    img(src="ghost-icons/gallu.png")
ul
    li Has three states: #[span.weakened *weakened*] → *normal* → #[span.enraged *enraged*].
    li Starts in *normal* state, and cycles to the next state on certain triggers.
    li Cycles #[span.weakened *weakened*] → *normal*, or *normal* → #[span.enraged *enraged*] when crucifix burnt, disoriented by incense during a hunt, or shortly after stepping in salt.
    li Cycles to #[span.weakened *weakened*] if a hunt ends while #[span.enraged *enraged*].
    li Sanity Hunt Threshold is #[span.weakened 40%] / 50% / #[span.enraged 60%].
    li Hunting Speed is #[span.weakened 20% slower] / normal / #[span.enraged 15% faster].
    li Hunt Initiation blocking range of crucifixes is #[span.weakened +1m] / normal / #[span.enraged -2m].
    li Incense disorientation duration during hunt is #[span.weakened 20% longer] / normal / #[span.enraged 20% shorter].
    li Cannot disturb salt while #[span.enraged *enraged*].
ul.evidence
    +emf
    +ultraviolet
    +box
    +earlyhunt
    +fast
    +slow